"lemma":"amar","gloss":"battle"}],"gloss":"great battle"},{"surface":"உழந்த","parts":[{"text":"உழந்த","lemma":"uḻa","gloss":"endured"}],"gloss":"endured"},{"surface":"வெருவரு","parts":[{"text":"வெரு","lemma":"veru","gloss":"fear"},{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"causing"}],"gloss":"fear-inducing"},{"surface":"பறந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"பறந்தலை","lemma":"paṟantalai","gloss":"battlefield"}],"gloss":"battlefield"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விழுநவி","parts":[{"text":"விழு","lemma":"viḦu","gloss":"heavy/great"},{"text":"நவி","lemma":"navi","gloss":"axe"}],"gloss":"heavy axe"},{"surface":"பாய்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"பாய்ந்த","lemma":"pāy","gloss":"struck"}],"gloss":"struck"},{"surface":"மரத்தின்","parts":[{"text":"மரத்தின்","lemma":"மரத்தின்","gloss":"like a tree"}],"gloss":"like a tree","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாண்மிசை","parts":[{"text":"வாண்மிசை","lemma":"வாண்மிசை","gloss":"upon the sword"}],"gloss":"upon the sword","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கிடந்த","parts":[{"text":"கிடந்த","lemma":"kiṭa","gloss":"lying"}],"gloss":"lying"},{"surface":"ஆண்மையோன்","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்மை","lemma":"āṇmai","gloss":"valor"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ōṉ","gloss":"he who has"}],"gloss":"the brave man"},{"surface":"திறத்தே","parts":[{"text":"திறத்து","lemma":"tiṟam","gloss":"matter/state"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"concerning indeed"}]}],"literal":"Many stars twinkling vast sky's / roaring drum's herd-abundant elephant / earth-spanning rolled chariot-owners too / battlefield gathered themselves-desire-indeed / fragrant-perfume abandoned unscented grey-headed / children's mother! great-house woman! / grieve I-indeed look-please you-indeed / valiant-army proclaiming sharp-sounding drum / sweet-sound heard approach-difficult warriors / victory-giving desire-having common-ground to-capture / great-battle endured fear-inducing battlefield / heavy-axe struck tree-like / sword-upon lying brave-man concerning.","translation":"Even the great kings who roll their chariot wheels across the wide earth, possessing herds of elephants and roaring war drums under the vast sky twinkling with many stars, gather on the battlefield and desire his glory. O mother of young sons, noble woman of a great house, whose grey hair is now devoid of fragrant oils! I grieve indeed; please look! On this terrifying battlefield where a great war was fought, he lies fallen upon his sword like a tree struck down by a heavy axe—this brave warrior who, hearing the sweet sound of the war drum that summons the valiant army, rushed with other unapproachable warriors eager for victory to capture the common ground.","modern":"பல விண்மீன்கள் இமைக்கும் பெரிய வானத்தின் கீழ், முழங்கும் முரசுகளையும், கூட்டமாக விளங்கும் யானைகளையும் கொண்டு, உலகமெங்கும் தம் தேர்களை உருட்டி ஆளும் அரசர்களும் போர்க்களத்தில் கூடி வியந்து போற்றுகின்றனர். நறுமணம் மிக்க எண்ணெய்களைத் துறந்து, வாசனை இல்லாத நரைத்த தலையையுடைய, சிறுவர்களின் தாயே! சிறந்த குடியில் பிறந்த பெண்ணே! நான் வருந்துகிறேன்; நீயும் பார்! வீரர்களைப் போருக்கு அழைக்கும் தண்ணுமையின் இனிய ஓசையைக் கேட்டு, பகைவரால் நெருங்க முடியாத வீரர்கள், வெற்றியைத் தரும் ஆசையோடு போர்க்களத்தைக் கைப்பற்றப் பெரும் போர் புரிந்தனர். அச்சம் தரும் அந்தப் பாழ்வெளியில், பெரிய கோடரி பாய்ந்து வீழ்ந்த மரத்தைப் போல, தன் வாளின் மேல் வீழ்ந்து கிடக்கும் இந்த ஆண்மையுடைய வீரனின் நிலையைக் காண்பாயாக!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the karantai tiṇai and is set in the theme of kaiyaṟunilai, expressing helpless grief over a fallen hero. The poet, Kaḻāttalaiyār, addresses the mother of a young warrior who has died on the battlefield. He points out the body of her son, who lies fallen upon his sword like a mighty tree felled by a heavy axe. Even great kings with vast armies and roaring drums desire the heroic fame of this young warrior. The poet urges the mother, a noble woman of a proud lineage whose hair is now grey and unadorned, to look upon her son's ultimate sacrifice. The imagery of the fallen tree and the high-pitched war drum (taṇṇumai) underscores the tragic yet glorious nature of a warrior's death.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.5],[2.5,2.6],[2.6,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.73,4.38],[4.38,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,6.03],[6.15,6.27],[6.27,7.58],[7.58,7.7],[7.7,8.8],[8.8,9.0],[9.0,9.5],[9.5,10.2],[10.2,10.77],[10.77,11.1],[11.1,11.2],[11.2,11.8],[11.8,13.0],[13.0,13.1],[13.1,14.0],[14.0,14.3],[14.3,15.1],[15.1,15.2],[15.2,15.6],[15.6,16.3],[17.28,17.88],[17.88,18.28],[18.28,18.28],[18.28,18.68],[18.68,20.03],[20.03,20.58],[20.58,20.88],[20.88,21.08],[21.08,22.08],[22.08,22.28],[22.28,22.58],[22.58,22.98],[22.98,24.22],[24.38,24.78],[24.78,24.98],[24.98,25.98],[25.98,26.48],[26.48,26.98],[26.98,27.32]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.4],[2.4,2.5],[2.5,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.85,4.54],[4.54,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.1],[6.1,7.12],[7.25,7.63],[7.63,7.89],[8.14,8.4],[8.4,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.3],[10.3,11.1],[11.1,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.2],[12.2,12.9],[12.9,12.9],[12.9,13.85],[14.8,14.9],[14.9,15.8],[15.8,16.8],[16.8,16.9],[16.9,17.4],[17.4,18.2],[19.2,19.8],[19.8,20.2],[20.2,20.2],[20.2,20.7],[20.7,22.01],[22.01,22.8],[22.8,23.1],[23.1,23.3],[23.3,24.4],[24.4,24.6],[24.6,24.9],[24.9,25.3],[25.3,26.44],[26.44,26.9],[26.9,27.7],[27.7,28.7],[28.7,29.1],[29.1,29.34],[29.34,29.64]]},"sync":[[["பன்மீன்","many stars"]],[["இமைக்கும்","twinkling"]],[["மாக","vast"]],[["விசும்பின்","of the sky"]],[["இரங்கு","sounding"]],[["முரசின்","of the drum"]],[["இனம்சால்","abundant in herds"]],[["யானை","elephant"]],[["நிலந்தவ","spanning the earth"]],[["உருட்டிய","rolled"]],[["நேமியோரும்","and those with wheeled chariots"]],[["நேமியோரும்","and those with wheeled chariots"]],[["சமங்கண்","battlefield"]],[["கூடி","having gathered"]],[["தாம்","themselves"],["வேட்பவ்வே","they desire/praise indeed"]],[["வேட்பவ்வே","they desire/praise indeed"]],[["நறுவிரை","fragrant perfume"]],[["துறந்த","abandoned"]],[["நாறா","unscented"]],[["நரைத்தலை","grey head"]]